# TEASER: no drive-by refactors

> This is a Driftwatch teaser rule, not the full kit.

If the ticket is a null check, do not also reformat billing, rewrite
the linter config, or "clean up" a sibling file in the same directory.

The paid pack treats multi-area diffs and same-directory siblings
without a Scope block as a failed PR (`out_of_scope`), not a style
note. This teaser does not.
